an has Hash over (orders) (builds the in-memory hash table for a Hash Join). The AI's reason: \"Hash table for orders.\"\n\nSIMILARITIES\n- Both plans join the tables in the same order (every intermediate join result is the same).\n- Both plans use Hash Join of (lineitem, part) with (supplier).\n- Both plans use Hash Join of (lineitem) with (part).\n- Both plans use Seq Scan on lineitem.\n- Both plans use Seq Scan on part.\n- Both plans use Seq Scan on supplier.",
